{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19953","headline":"夜集汝州郡斋听陆僧辩弹琴 · 孟郊","name":"夜集汝州郡斋听陆僧辩弹琴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"康乐宠词客，清宵意无穷。\n徵文北山外，借月南楼中。\n千里愁并尽，一樽欢暂同。\n胡爲戛楚琴，淅沥起寒风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19953.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19953","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}